                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001377"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The vastus medialis, often called the &apos;teardrop&apos; muscle, is a medially located muscle of the quadriceps. [WP,unvetted].</obo:IAO_0000115>
