        <OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>scaphoid</OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>scaphoid bone</OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>scaphoideum</OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <OboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>uberon</OboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
