            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Subdivision of trunk proper, which is demarcated from the pelvis by the inferior surface of the pelvic diaphragm and from the lower limbs by the perineofemoral lines; together with the thorax, abdomen, and pelvis, it constitutes the trunk[FMA].</obo:IAO_0000115>
