        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Distal segment of the fore limb, including carpal region, metacarpal region and digits.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000232>like all limb segments, this class encompasses both the unformed hand region of the embryo to the fully formed structure complete with skeleton</obo:IAO_0000232>
        <obo:IAO_0000412 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/uberon.owl"/>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000007>manual</obo:UBPROP_0000007>
