        <obo:UBPROP_0000003>homology debated</obo:UBPROP_0000003>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000003>the cleithrum, the major shoulder bone of extinct land vertebrate ancestors,.. appears to survive as the scapular spine in living mammals[Matsuoka, PMC1352163]</obo:UBPROP_0000003>
