        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A subdivision of an organism along the anterior-posterior axis in the pelvic region immediately posterior to the lumbar region and anterior to the caudal region. Sometimes an intermediate region is defined between the sacral and caudal.</obo:IAO_0000115>
