        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0003661"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0009877"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any of the muscles of the autopod region that lie between metacarpal or metatarsal bones.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000412 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/uberon.owl"/>
        <OboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>interosseous</OboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>
        <OboInOwl:hasDbXref>Wikipedia:Interossei</OboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>interosseus muscle</OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>m. interosseous</OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <OboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>uberon</OboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <OboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>interossei</OboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <OboInOwl:id>UBERON:0006508</OboInOwl:id>
        <OboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.oboInOwllibrary.org/oboInOwl/uberon/core#human_subset"/>
        <OboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.oboInOwllibrary.org/oboInOwl/uberon/core#mouse_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label>interosseous muscle of autopod</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0006633 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0006633">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0005913"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0006849"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A process of the scapula in most mammals representing the remnant of the coracoid bone of lower vertebrates thas has become fused with the scapula.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000412 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/uberon.owl"/>
        <obo:RO_0002175 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_9606"/>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>The coracoid process is a small hook-like structure on the lateral edge of the superior anterior portion of the scapula. Pointing laterally forward, it, together with the acromion, serves to stabilize the shoulder joint. It is palpable in the deltopectoral groove between the deltoid and pectoralis major muscles. It is the site of attachment for several structures: * The pectoralis minor muscle - to 3rd to 5th ribs. * The short head of biceps brachii muscle - to Radial tuberosity. * The coracobrachialis muscle - to medial humerus. * The coracoclavicular ligament - to the clavicle. (The ligament is formed by the conoid ligament and trapezoid ligament.) * The coracoacromial ligament - to the acromion[WP][Wikipedia:Coracoid_process].</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000008>In humans is situated on its superior border and serves for the attachment of various muscles</obo:UBPROP_0000008>
        <OboInOwl:hasDbXref>EMAPA:25121</OboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <OboInOwl:hasDbXref>FMA:13455</OboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <OboInOwl:hasDbXref>SCTID:181912007</OboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <OboInOwl:hasDbXref>Wikipedia:Coracoid_process</OboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>coracoid process</OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>coracoid process of the scapula</OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <OboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>uberon</OboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <OboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>processus coracoideus</OboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <OboInOwl:id>UBERON:0006633</OboInOwl:id>
        <OboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.oboInOwllibrary.org/oboInOwl/uberon/core#human_reference_atlas"/>
        <OboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.oboInOwllibrary.org/oboInOwl/uberon/core#human_subset"/>
        <OboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.oboInOwllibrary.org/oboInOwl/uberon/core#mouse_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label>coracoid process of scapula</rdfs:label>
        <foaf:depiction rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">http://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a6/Gray205_left_scapula_lateral_view.png</foaf:depiction>
    </owl:Class>
    


