        <obo:IAO_0000115>A bone that is part of a pectoral complex. Examples: scapula, manus phalanx, any carpal bone, any bone of the pectoral fin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>considering adding pectoral and pelvic complex skeleton classes</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000412 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/uberon.owl"/>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000012>note that the MA class includes girdle parts so it belongs here;</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
        <OboInOwl:hasDbXref>EMAPA:35933</OboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <OboInOwl:hasDbXref>MA:0000612</OboInOwl:hasDbXref>
