        <OboInOwl:hasDbXref>Wikipedia:Ulnar_styloid_process</OboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>processus styloideus ulnae</OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>ulnar styloid process</OboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <OboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>uberon</OboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
