        <ilxtr:hasIlxId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795284"/>
        <ilxtr:hasIlxPreferredId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795284"/>
        <rdfs:label>infraclavicular fossa</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795285 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795285">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0006800"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000916"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A vertical line running along the midline of the anterior body surface, aligned with the sternum. On the anterior abdominal and chest walls, the anterior median line can be seen extending from the jugular notch, crossing over the sternum and linea alba in their midline, and reaching out to the midline pubic symphysis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <base:ilx_0112785 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000916"/>
        <ilxr:type rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/readable/type/term"/>
        <ilxtr:hasExistingId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795285"/>
        <ilxtr:hasIlxId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795285"/>
        <ilxtr:hasIlxPreferredId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795285"/>
        <rdfs:label>anterior median line</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795286 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795286">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001062"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0008785"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A triangular region bounded by the clavicle superiorly, the pectoralis major medially, and the deltoid laterally.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <base:ilx_0112785 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0008785"/>
        <ilxr:type rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/readable/type/term"/>
        <ilxtr:hasExistingId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795286"/>
        <ilxtr:hasIlxId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795286"/>
        <ilxtr:hasIlxPreferredId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795286"/>
        <rdfs:label>clavipectoral triangle</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795287 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795287">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001062"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001443"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The anterior boundary of the axilla, formed by the lower border of the pectoralis major muscle.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <base:ilx_0112785 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001443"/>
        <ilxr:type rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/readable/type/term"/>
        <ilxtr:hasExistingId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795287"/>
        <ilxtr:hasIlxId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795287"/>
        <ilxtr:hasIlxPreferredId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795287"/>
        <rdfs:label>anterior axillary fold</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795288 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795288">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001062"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0008785"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The posterior aspect of the wrist, containing the extensor tendons and underlying carpal bones.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <base:ilx_0112785 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0008785"/>
        <ilxr:type rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/readable/type/term"/>
        <ilxtr:hasExistingId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795288"/>
        <ilxtr:hasIlxId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795288"/>
        <ilxtr:hasIlxPreferredId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795288"/>
        <rdfs:label>dorsal wrist</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795289 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795289">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0004704"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001461"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The radial fossa, also called the anatomical snuffbox, is a triangular depression on the lateral wrist. It is bordered by the tendons of the extensor pollicis longus, extensor pollicis brevis, and abductor pollicis longus, with the scaphoid and trapezium forming its floor. It houses the radial artery and is clinically relevant for assessing scaphoid fractures or arterial pulse.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <base:ilx_0112785 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001461"/>
        <ilxr:type rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/readable/type/term"/>
        <ilxtr:hasExistingId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795289"/>
        <ilxtr:hasIlxId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795289"/>
        <ilxtr:hasIlxPreferredId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795289"/>
        <NIFRID:synonym>anatomical snuffbox</NIFRID:synonym>
        <rdfs:label>radial fossa</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795290 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795290">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000093"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001456"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A shallow groove extending from the lateral aspect of the nostril to the corner of the mouth.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <base:ilx_0112785 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001456"/>
        <ilxr:type rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/readable/type/term"/>
        <ilxtr:hasExistingId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795290"/>
        <ilxtr:hasIlxId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795290"/>
        <ilxtr:hasIlxPreferredId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795290"/>
        <rdfs:label>nasolabial sulcus</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795291 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795291">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001062"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0003129"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The mandibular notch, also known as the sigmoid notch, is a groove in the ramus of the mandible. A curved depression between the coronoid and condylar processes of the mandible.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <base:ilx_0112785 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0003129"/>
        <ilxr:type rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/readable/type/term"/>
        <ilxtr:hasExistingId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795291"/>
        <ilxtr:hasIlxId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795291"/>
        <ilxtr:hasIlxPreferredId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795291"/>
        <NIFRID:synonym>sigmoid notch</NIFRID:synonym>
        <rdfs:label>mandibular notch</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795292 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795292">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0006800"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000033"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The demarcation at the anterior margin of the scalp where hair growth begins.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <base:ilx_0112785 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000033"/>
        <ilxr:type rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/readable/type/term"/>
        <ilxtr:hasExistingId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795292"/>
        <ilxtr:hasIlxId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795292"/>
        <ilxtr:hasIlxPreferredId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795292"/>
        <rdfs:label>anterior hairline</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795293 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795293">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0004704"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000974"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A small depression located superior to the clavicle and medial to the clavicular head of the sternocleidomastoid muscle.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <base:ilx_0112785 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000974"/>
        <ilxr:type rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/readable/type/term"/>
        <ilxtr:hasExistingId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795293"/>
        <ilxtr:hasIlxId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795293"/>
        <ilxtr:hasIlxPreferredId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795293"/>
        <rdfs:label>lesser supraclavicular fossa</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795294 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795294">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0004704"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000974"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The greater supraclavicular fossa refers to the larger, lateral depression above the clavicle, located lateral to the sternocleidomastoid muscle.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <base:ilx_0112785 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000974"/>
        <ilxr:type rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/readable/type/term"/>
        <ilxtr:hasExistingId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795294"/>
        <ilxtr:hasIlxId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795294"/>
        <ilxtr:hasIlxPreferredId rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795294"/>
        <rdfs:label>greater supraclavicular fossa</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795295 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795295">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0012198"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The anatomical space between the second and third ribs, containing intercostal muscles, vessels, and nerves.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <base:ilx_0112785 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001443"/>
        <ilxr:type rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/readable/type/term"/>
