        <TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>Facial paralysis, twitching of eyelids, pain in the face, toothache, swelling of the cheek, yellowish sclera.</TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>
        <TARA:hasInnervationDescription>The facial and infraorbital nerves.</TARA:hasInnervationDescription>
