        <dcterms:bibliographicCitation>Source for the Acupoint Location: WHO Standard Acupuncture Point Locations in the Western Pacific Region. World Health Organization. Regional Office for the Western Pacific, 2008. Page 230. ISBN 978-92-9061-248-7.

Source for Acupuncture Method, Vasculature, Innervation, and Indications:
D. Liangyue, G. Yijun, H. Shuhui, et al. Chinese Acupuncture and Moxibustion. Revised ed. Beijing: Foreign Languages Press; 1999. Chapter 10, Acupuncture Points of the Governor and the Conception Vessels and the Extra Points. ISBN 978-7-119-01758-7.</dcterms:bibliographicCitation>
        <TARA:hasChineseLabel>璇璣(玑)</TARA:hasChineseLabel>
        <TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>Pain in the chest, cough, asthma.</TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>
        <TARA:hasInnervationDescription>The anterior branch of the supraclavicular nerve and the anterior cutaneous branch of the first intercostal nerve.</TARA:hasInnervationDescription>
        <TARA:hasLocationalDescription>In the anterior thoracic region, 1 B-cun inferior to the suprasternal fossa, on the anterior median line. Note: CV21 is located 1 B-cun inferior to CV22.</TARA:hasLocationalDescription>
        <TARA:hasMeridian rdf:resource="http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/TARA_6789717"/>
        <TARA:hasMethodDescription>Puncture subcutaneously 0.3-0.5 inch. Moxibustion is applicable.</TARA:hasMethodDescription>
        <TARA:hasPinyinLabel>Xuanji</TARA:hasPinyinLabel>
        <TARA:hasRelatedLocation rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795285"/>
        <TARA:hasRelatedLocation rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795331"/>
        <TARA:hasSurfaceLocation rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0016416"/>
        <TARA:hasSynonym>Conception Vessel 21</TARA:hasSynonym>
        <TARA:hasSynonym>RN 21</TARA:hasSynonym>
        <TARA:hasSynonym>Ren 21</TARA:hasSynonym>
        <TARA:hasVasculatureDescription>See Zhongting (CV 16).</TARA:hasVasculatureDescription>
        <rdfs:label>CV 21</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/TARA_1452771 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/TARA_1452771">
