        <TARA:hasChineseLabel>膝關(关,関)</TARA:hasChineseLabel>
        <TARA:hasInnervationDescription>The branch of the medial sural cutaneous nerve; deeper, the tibial nerve.</TARA:hasInnervationDescription>
