        <TARA:hasChineseLabel>屋翳</TARA:hasChineseLabel>
        <TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>Fullness and pain in the chest and the costal region, cough, asthma, mastitis.</TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>
        <TARA:hasInnervationDescription>On the course of the branch of m. pectoralis major derived from the anterior thoracic nerve.</TARA:hasInnervationDescription>
        <TARA:hasLocationalDescription>In the anterior thoracic region, in the sec- ond intercostal space, 4 B-cun lateral to the anterior median line. Note: The second intercostal space is in- ferior to the second rib which is located at the same level as the sternal angle.</TARA:hasLocationalDescription>
        <TARA:hasMeridian rdf:resource="http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/TARA_6221269"/>
        <TARA:hasPinyinLabel>Wuyi</TARA:hasPinyinLabel>
