        <dcterms:bibliographicCitation>Source for the Acupoint Location: WHO Standard Acupuncture Point Locations in the Western Pacific Region. World Health Organization. Regional Office for the Western Pacific, 2008. Page 225. ISBN 978-92-9061-248-7.

Source for Acupuncture Method, Vasculature, Innervation, and Indications:
D. Liangyue, G. Yijun, H. Shuhui, et al. Chinese Acupuncture and Moxibustion. Revised ed. Beijing: Foreign Languages Press; 1999. Chapter 10, Acupuncture Points of the Governor and the Conception Vessels and the Extra Points. ISBN 978-7-119-01758-7.</dcterms:bibliographicCitation>
        <TARA:hasChineseLabel>建里</TARA:hasChineseLabel>
        <TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>Stomachache, vomiting, abdominal distension, borborygmus, edema, anorexia.</TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>
        <TARA:hasInnervationDescription>The anterior cutaneous branch of the eighth intercostal nerve.</TARA:hasInnervationDescription>
        <TARA:hasLocationalDescription>On the upper abdomen, 3 B-cun superior to the centre of the umbilicus, on the anterior median line.</TARA:hasLocationalDescription>
        <TARA:hasMeridian rdf:resource="http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/TARA_6789717"/>
        <TARA:hasMethodDescription>Puncture perpendicularly 0.5-1.2 inches. Moxibustion is applicable.</TARA:hasMethodDescription>
        <TARA:hasPinyinLabel>Jianli</TARA:hasPinyinLabel>
        <TARA:hasRelatedLocation rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0007118"/>
        <TARA:hasRelatedLocation rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795285"/>
        <TARA:hasSurfaceLocation rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795301"/>
        <TARA:hasSynonym>Conception Vessel 11</TARA:hasSynonym>
        <TARA:hasSynonym>RN 11</TARA:hasSynonym>
        <TARA:hasSynonym>Ren 11</TARA:hasSynonym>
        <TARA:hasVasculatureDescription>The branches of the superior and inferior epigastric arteries.</TARA:hasVasculatureDescription>
        <rdfs:label>CV 11</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


