        <TARA:hasChineseLabel>瞳子髎(髎)</TARA:hasChineseLabel>
        <TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>Headache, redness and pain of the eyes, failing of vision, lacrimation, deviation of the eye and mouth.</TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>
        <TARA:hasInnervationDescription>The zygomaticofacial and zygomaticotemporal nerve, the temporal branch of the facial nerve.</TARA:hasInnervationDescription>
        <TARA:hasLocationalDescription>On the head, in the depression, 0.5 B-cun lateral to the outer canthus of the eye.</TARA:hasLocationalDescription>
