        <TARA:hasChineseLabel>手五里</TARA:hasChineseLabel>
        <TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>Contracture and pain of the elbow and arm, scrofula.</TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>
        <TARA:hasInnervationDescription>The posterior antebrachial cutaneous nerve; deeper, the radial nerve.</TARA:hasInnervationDescription>
        <TARA:hasLocationalDescription>On the lateral aspect of the arm, on the line connecting LI11 with LI15, 3 B-cun supe- rior to the cubital crease.</TARA:hasLocationalDescription>
