        <dcterms:bibliographicCitation>Source for the Acupoint Location: WHO Standard Acupuncture Point Locations in the Western Pacific Region. World Health Organization. Regional Office for the Western Pacific, 2008. Page 179. ISBN 978-92-9061-248-7.

Source for Acupuncture Method, Vasculature, Innervation, and Indications:
D. Liangyue, G. Yijun, H. Shuhui, et al. Chinese Acupuncture and Moxibustion. Revised ed. Beijing: Foreign Languages Press; 1999. Chapter 9, Acupuncture Points of the Jueyin and Shaoyang Meridian. ISBN 978-7-119-01758-7.</dcterms:bibliographicCitation>
        <TARA:hasChineseLabel>頭(头)臨(临)泣</TARA:hasChineseLabel>
        <TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>Headache, vertigo, lacrimation, pain in the outer canthus, rhinorrhea, nasal obstruction.</TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>
        <TARA:hasInnervationDescription>The anastomotic branch of the medial and lateral branches of the frontal nerve.</TARA:hasInnervationDescription>
        <TARA:hasLocationalDescription>On the head, 0.5 B-cun within the anterior hairline, directly superior to the centre of the pupil. Note: When looking straight ahead, GB15 is superior to the centre of the pupil, at the midpoint of the curved line from gV24 to St8.</TARA:hasLocationalDescription>
        <TARA:hasMeridian rdf:resource="http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/TARA_5283975"/>
        <TARA:hasMethodDescription>Puncture subcutaneously 0.3-0.5 inch. Moxibustion is applicable.</TARA:hasMethodDescription>
        <TARA:hasPinyinLabel>Toulinqi</TARA:hasPinyinLabel>
        <TARA:hasRelatedLocation rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001771"/>
        <TARA:hasRelatedLocation rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795292"/>
        <TARA:hasSurfaceLocation rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000033"/>
        <TARA:hasSynonym>G 15</TARA:hasSynonym>
        <TARA:hasSynonym>Gallbladder 15</TARA:hasSynonym>
        <TARA:hasVasculatureDescription>The frontal artery and vein.</TARA:hasVasculatureDescription>
        <rdfs:label>GB 15</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


