        <TARA:hasChineseLabel>步(歩)廊</TARA:hasChineseLabel>
        <TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>Cough, asthma, distension and fullness in the chest and hypochondriac region vomiting, anorexia.</TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>
