        <dcterms:bibliographicCitation>Source for the Acupoint Location: WHO Standard Acupuncture Point Locations in the Western Pacific Region. World Health Organization. Regional Office for the Western Pacific, 2008. Page 35. ISBN 978-92-9061-248-7.

Source for Acupuncture Method, Vasculature, Innervation, and Indications:
D. Liangyue, G. Yijun, H. Shuhui, et al. Chinese Acupuncture and Moxibustion. Revised ed. Beijing: Foreign Languages Press; 1999. Chapter 7, Acupuncture Points of the Taiyin and Yangming Meridian. ISBN 978-7-119-01758-7.</dcterms:bibliographicCitation>
        <TARA:hasChineseLabel>三間(间)</TARA:hasChineseLabel>
        <TARA:hasDesignatedSpecialPointRole rdf:resource="http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/TARA_6705086"/>
        <TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>Toothache, ophthalmalgia, sore throat, redness and swelling of fingers and the dorsum of the hand.</TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>
        <TARA:hasInnervationDescription>The superficial ramus of the radial nerve.</TARA:hasInnervationDescription>
        <TARA:hasLocationalDescription>On the dorsum of the hand, in the depression radial and proximal to the second metacarpophalangeal joint.</TARA:hasLocationalDescription>
        <TARA:hasMeridian rdf:resource="http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/TARA_4610474"/>
        <TARA:hasMethodDescription>Puncture perpendicularly 0.5-0.8 inch. Moxibustion is applicable.</TARA:hasMethodDescription>
        <TARA:hasPinyinLabel>Sanjian</TARA:hasPinyinLabel>
        <TARA:hasRelatedLocation rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0003695"/>
        <TARA:hasSurfaceLocation rdf:resource="http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0794954"/>
        <TARA:hasSynonym>Large Intestine 3</TARA:hasSynonym>
        <TARA:hasVasculatureDescription>The dorsal venous network of the hand and the branch of the first dorsal metacarpal artery.</TARA:hasVasculatureDescription>
        <rdfs:label>LI 3</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/TARA_7870889 -->

