        <dcterms:bibliographicCitation>Source for the Acupoint Location: WHO Standard Acupuncture Point Locations in the Western Pacific Region. World Health Organization. Regional Office for the Western Pacific, 2008. Page 163. ISBN 978-92-9061-248-7.

Source for Acupuncture Method, Vasculature, Innervation, and Indications:
D. Liangyue, G. Yijun, H. Shuhui, et al. Chinese Acupuncture and Moxibustion. Revised ed. Beijing: Foreign Languages Press; 1999. Chapter 9, Acupuncture Points of the Jueyin and Shaoyang Meridian. ISBN 978-7-119-01758-7.</dcterms:bibliographicCitation>
        <TARA:hasChineseLabel>消濼(泺)</TARA:hasChineseLabel>
        <TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>Headache, neck rigidity, motor impairment and pain of the arm.</TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>
        <TARA:hasInnervationDescription>The posterior brachial cutaneous nerve and the muscular branch of the radial nerve.</TARA:hasInnervationDescription>
        <TARA:hasLocationalDescription>On the posterior aspect of the arm, on the line connecting the prominence of the olecranon with the acromial angle, 5 B-cun proximal to the prominence of the olecranon.</TARA:hasLocationalDescription>
        <TARA:hasMeridian rdf:resource="http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/TARA_3898257"/>
        <TARA:hasMethodDescription>Puncture perpendicularly 0.5-0.7 inch. Moxibustion is applicable.</TARA:hasMethodDescription>
        <TARA:hasPinyinLabel>Xiaoluo</TARA:hasPinyinLabel>
        <TARA:hasRelatedLocation rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0006810"/>
        <TARA:hasSurfaceLocation rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001460"/>
        <TARA:hasSynonym>SJ 12</TARA:hasSynonym>
        <TARA:hasSynonym>San Jiao 12</TARA:hasSynonym>
        <TARA:hasSynonym>TB 12</TARA:hasSynonym>
        <TARA:hasSynonym>TH 12</TARA:hasSynonym>
        <TARA:hasSynonym>TW 12</TARA:hasSynonym>
        <TARA:hasSynonym>Triple Burner 12</TARA:hasSynonym>
        <TARA:hasSynonym>Triple Energizer 12</TARA:hasSynonym>
        <TARA:hasSynonym>Triple Heater 12</TARA:hasSynonym>
        <TARA:hasSynonym>Triple Warmer 12</TARA:hasSynonym>
        <TARA:hasVasculatureDescription>The median collateral artery and vein.</TARA:hasVasculatureDescription>
        <rdfs:label>TE 12</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


