        <TARA:hasChineseLabel>靈(灵,霊)墟(墟)</TARA:hasChineseLabel>
        <TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>Cough, asthma, fullness in the chest and hypochondriac region, mastitis.</TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>
        <TARA:hasInnervationDescription>The anterior cutaneous branch of the third intercostal nerve; deeper, the third intercostal nerve.</TARA:hasInnervationDescription>
        <TARA:hasLocationalDescription>In the anterior thoracic region, in the third intercostal space, 2 B-cun lateral to the anterior median line.</TARA:hasLocationalDescription>
