        <TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>Knee pain, weakness of the lower extremities.</TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>
        <TARA:hasLocationalDescription>A Xiyan point located in the depression, medial to the patellar ligament, locating the point with the knee flexed.</TARA:hasLocationalDescription>
        <TARA:hasMethodDescription>Puncture perpendicularly 0.5- 1.0 inch. Moxibustion is applicable.</TARA:hasMethodDescription>
