        <TARA:hasLocationalDescription>On the head, 4 B-cun within the anterior hairline, directly superior to the centre of the pupil. Note: GB18 is 1.5 B-cun posterior to gB17, at the same level as BL7.</TARA:hasLocationalDescription>
