        <TARA:hasDesignatedSpecialPointRole rdf:resource="http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/TARA_7315457"/>
        <TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>Migraine, pain of the outer canthus, pain in the axillary region, scrofula, lumbar pain, pain in the chest, hypochondriac region and lateral aspect of the lower extremities, malaria.</TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>
        <TARA:hasLocationalDescription>On the fibular aspect of the leg, anterior to the fibula, 4 B-cun proximal to the prominence of the lateral malleolus.</TARA:hasLocationalDescription>
