        <TARA:hasChineseLabel>陽(阳)白</TARA:hasChineseLabel>
        <TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>Headache in the frontal region, pain of the orbital ridge, eye pain, vertigo, twitching of the eyelids, ptosis of the eyelids, lacrimation.</TARA:hasIndicationsDescription>
